__INPUT_CONSTRAINTS__ = `{
  "description": "Provide either 'url' or 'packet', exclusively. Callback is not started on validation failure.",
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "required": [
        "url"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "url": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "\\S"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "required": [
        "packet"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "packet": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "\\S"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "properties": {
    "headers": {
      "propertyNames": {
        "pattern": "^[!#$%&'*+.^_\u0060|~0-9A-Za-z-]+$"
      },
      "pattern": "^(?:[ \\t]*(?:[!#$%&'*+.^_\u0060|~0-9A-Za-z-]+[ \\t]*:[^\\r\\n]*)?(?:\\r?\\n|$))*$"
    }
  }
}`

__DESC__ = "统一执行单包与批量 HTTP 测试、路径枚举、接口批量验证、IDOR/越权验证和请求重放。url 或 packet 二选一；fuzztag=true 时用 {{int(1-10)}}、{{list(a|b)}}、{{params(name)}} 的 variables 数组构成多包，同层 ::row 同步配对，其余标签取笛卡尔积，支持嵌套编码与 repeat 重复请求。一次调用完成展开、并发发包、响应筛选、逐包请求/响应预览、关键词/正则匹配上下文、状态统计、汇总表和完整响应/结果文件；单包保留详细报文。"
__VERBOSE_NAME__ = "HTTP Request"
__VERBOSE_NAME_ZH__ = "HTTP请求"
__KEYWORDS__ = "batch http,batch request,concurrent,multi path,path enumeration,api endpoint validation,idor validation,request replay,批量HTTP,并发请求,路径枚举,接口批量验证,未授权访问验证,越权验证,IDOR验证,请求重放,http request,curl,web,network,packet,raw request,http response,url,post,get,https,proxy,redirect,header,body,api,http tool,web debug,traffic"

__USAGE__ = <<<USAGE_BLOCK
HTTP 请求测试：`url` 与 `packet` 二选一。URL 模式由工具生成请求包；需要重复参数、固定顺序或自定义编码时用原样 `packet`。`fuzztag:true` 可将同一模板展开成多包并发测试；批量请求也使用本工具，先把变化的路径、目标或载荷放入 FuzzTag/variables；一次调用执行全部组合，不要逐个循环调用。

参数要点：URL 模式的 `query`/`form` 是 JSON 对象，传原始未转义值，由工具各编码一次；不要先编码 `%`、`&` 等字符。`body` 是原始请求体，覆盖 `form`；Packet 模式的路径和查询必须自行编码。`headers` 可传对象或逐行的 `Key: Value`。默认 `timeout=10` 秒、`redirect-times=3`；仅在结果可能涉及漏洞或确需完整报文复核时设置 `save-packet=true` 保存请求和响应，普通探测保持默认，大报文内联输出会截断。

先看 `RESULT.request_built`、`request_sent`、`response_received`、`status_code` 和 `transport_error`：HTTP 404/500 仍是已收到响应；连接、TLS、代理等失败则没有响应。POST JSON 请求遇到包含 required/invalid/missing 的 HTTP 400 时，工具可能自动改为表单编码再请求一次；核对输出中的 retry request packet 和 content-type hint，不能把重试响应当作原 JSON 请求的结果。

测试时先留正常基线，再一次改变一个变量并比较状态、内容、响应头和耗时。参数校验失败、超时、空响应或一次未命中都需要修正请求或换一个可区分的实验；响应揭示的新入口应记录到待办。

典型案例：URL 模式提交表单，参数直接传对象：
[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
arguments 示例：
```json
{
  "url": "https://target.example/submit",
  "method": "POST",
  "form": {
    "name": "a & b"
  },
  "timeout": 10
}
```
[[- else -]]
文本流 action：
```json
{
  "@action": "directly_call_tool",
  "directly_call_tool_name": "do_http_request",
  "directly_call_tool_params": {
    "url": "https://target.example/submit",
    "method": "POST",
    "form": {
      "name": "a & b"
    },
    "timeout": 10
  }
}
```
[[- end -]]

[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
精确报文：所有参数直接放在 JSON 中，多行报文用 JSON 转义：
arguments 示例：
```json
{
  "packet": "POST /submit HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: target.example\r\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\r\n\r\nname=a%20%26%20b",
  "https": "yes",
  "timeout": 10
}
```
[[- else -]]
精确报文：其他参数用 JSON，多行 `packet` 使用本次 nonce 的 AITAG：
文本流 action：
```json
{
  "@action": "directly_call_tool",
  "directly_call_tool_name": "do_http_request",
  "directly_call_tool_params": {
    "https": "yes",
    "timeout": 10
  }
}
```
<|TOOL_PARAM_packet_{NONCE}|>
POST /submit HTTP/1.1
Host: target.example
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=a%20%26%20b
<|TOOL_PARAM_packet_END_{NONCE}|>
[[- end -]]
FuzzTag 发包辅助：设置 `fuzztag=true`，直接在 `packet` 或 URL 模式的 `url`、`headers`、`body`、`query`/`form` 值中写标签，省去先调用 exec_fuzztag 再复制报文的步骤。默认 false 保留原样文本。`variables` 支持标量或数组，用 `{{params(name)}}` 取值；变量插入后不会作为标签再次执行。URL 模式先渲染再编码 query/form 一次，结构化值不要再套 urlescape/urlenc；精确 packet 模式自行处理编码。自动根据展开结果选择单包或多包输出；`max-requests` 默认 100、最多 500，超限整批不发送；`concurrent` 默认 5，设为 1 可顺序发送。文件/插件标签未启用；未知标签、缺失变量、未闭合模板会报错。

嵌套编码单请求：
[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
```json
{"url":"https://target.example/query","query":{"token":"{{base64({{params(payload)}})}}"},"variables":{"payload":"a & b"},"fuzztag":true}
```
[[- else -]]
```json
{"@action":"directly_call_tool","directly_call_tool_name":"do_http_request","directly_call_tool_params":{"url":"https://target.example/query","query":{"token":"{{base64({{params(payload)}})}}"},"variables":{"payload":"a & b"},"fuzztag":true}}
```
[[- end -]]
范围与编码多包测试（10 份请求）：
[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
```json
{"url":"https://target.example/users/{{int(1-10)}}","query":{"token":"{{base64({{hex(abc)}})}}"},"fuzztag":true,"max-requests":10,"concurrent":5}
```
[[- else -]]
```json
{"@action":"directly_call_tool","directly_call_tool_name":"do_http_request","directly_call_tool_params":{"url":"https://target.example/users/{{int(1-10)}}","query":{"token":"{{base64({{hex(abc)}})}}"},"fuzztag":true,"max-requests":10,"concurrent":5}}
```
[[- end -]]
精确 packet 中嵌套编码与范围（JSON 报文字符串使用真实的 JSON 转义）：
[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
```json
{"packet":"GET /query?id={{int(1-10)}}&token={{urlescape({{base64(a & b)}})}} HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: target.example\r\n\r\n","https":"yes","fuzztag":true,"max-requests":10}
```
[[- else -]]
```json
{"@action":"directly_call_tool","directly_call_tool_name":"do_http_request","directly_call_tool_params":{"packet":"GET /query?id={{int(1-10)}}&token={{urlescape({{base64(a & b)}})}} HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: target.example\r\n\r\n","https":"yes","fuzztag":true,"max-requests":10}}
```
[[- end -]]
默认不同标签取笛卡尔积；需要字段一一配对时给同层标签使用相同 `::row`，如 URL 的 `{{int::row(1-2)}}` 与 query 的 `{{list::row(reader|admin)}}`。重复请求用 `{{repeat(3)}}`，不会去重。

如何构成批量请求：
1. 选一个正常请求作为模板，保留认证头、Cookie、方法与请求体。URL 模式使用一个完整 `url`；packet 模式把路径、Header、Body 的变化写在同一份报文中。
2. 数字范围直接写 `{{int(1-10)}}`；少量路径用 `{{list(/health|/api/users|/admin)}}`；已有路径列表传 `variables:{"path":["/health","/api/users","/admin"]}`，URL 写成 `https://target.example{{params(path)}}`。多个站点直接用 `url:"{{params(target)}}"` 配完整 URL 数组。`variables` 中的元素是原始字面值，不会作为标签再次执行。
3. 默认所有独立标签取笛卡尔积：2 个 ID × 2 种载荷 = 4 包。需要字段一一对应时在同层标签使用相同 `::row`；例如 URL 的 `{{int::row(1-2)}}` 与 query 的 `{{list::row(reader|admin)}}` 只发 2 包。`{{repeat(3)}}` 保留 3 次重复请求。
4. 设置 `fuzztag:true` 才执行标签。`max-requests` 限制最终组合数（包含重复项），默认 100、最多 500；模板错误或超限在发送前整批报错。`concurrent` 默认 5，控制网络并发；`delay-seconds` 设置间隔并强制顺序发送。先用小样本核对实际 request，再扩大范围。

路径列表 × 载荷数组，一次调用发 6 包，query/form 的原始值只编码一次：
[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
```json
{"url":"https://target.example{{params(path)}}","method":"POST","headers":{"Cookie":"session=demo"},"form":{"input":"{{params(payload)}}"},"variables":{"path":["/health","/api/users","/admin"],"payload":["normal","a & b"]},"fuzztag":true,"max-requests":6,"concurrent":3}
```
[[- else -]]
```json
{"@action":"directly_call_tool","directly_call_tool_name":"do_http_request","directly_call_tool_params":{"url":"https://target.example{{params(path)}}","method":"POST","headers":{"Cookie":"session=demo"},"form":{"input":"{{params(payload)}}"},"variables":{"path":["/health","/api/users","/admin"],"payload":["normal","a & b"]},"fuzztag":true,"max-requests":6,"concurrent":3}}
```
[[- end -]]
两个 ID 与两个角色同步配对：
[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
```json
{"url":"https://target.example/users/{{int::row(1-2)}}","query":{"role":"{{list::row(reader|admin)}}"},"fuzztag":true,"max-requests":2}
```
[[- else -]]
```json
{"@action":"directly_call_tool","directly_call_tool_name":"do_http_request","directly_call_tool_params":{"url":"https://target.example/users/{{int::row(1-2)}}","query":{"role":"{{list::row(reader|admin)}}"},"fuzztag":true,"max-requests":2}}
```
[[- end -]]

输出与筛选：单包保留 `RESULT.request_built/request_sent/response_received/status_code/transport_error` 和详细报文。多包自动输出 Batch Request Summary、逐包 URL/Path/HTTPS、实际 request 预览、Response 预览、关键词/正则匹配上下文、完整响应文件路径、Results Summary Table 和结果文件。`max-body-size` 默认 4096 字节，设 0 隐藏批量响应预览；完整响应仍自动保存。`include-code:"200,302"` 只展示指定状态，`exclude-code:"404"` 排除状态，`exclude-size:"0,400-600"` 排除响应大小；过滤只影响展示，不证明目标安全，过滤项也保留执行状态与响应文件。

多包 `RESULT` 返回 `mode:multi`、`request_count`、`request_completed_count`、`request_sent_count`、`response_received_count`、`filtered_count`、`transport_error_count`、`status_code_distribution`、`output_file` 和按模板顺序排列的 `items`。每项含 idx、url/path/https、执行状态、status_code/body_size/duration_ms、filtered/filter_reason、匹配次数及上下文、最多 5KB 的 request/response 预览、response_file 和 artifact_error。404/500 计入已收到响应；筛选后也计入状态分布。连接、TLS、代理等错误单独记录，失败包不影响其他包。文件保存失败只报告 artifact_error，不重新发包。内联结果总量超过 50KB 时截断，完整结果查看 output_file。

`verbose:true` 可在发送时展示逐包报文与连接信息；`save-packet:true` 额外保存完整请求，完整响应在多包模式始终保存。多包不自动做 JSON→form 重试，便于比较原始测试。单包与多包都用本工具：拿到差异后收缩为一份请求，再深测与复核；发现新入口先记入待办。
标签原样发送：不设置 fuzztag，或用 `{{=原文=}}` 保留模板中的局部文本。
USAGE_BLOCK

yakit.AutoInitYakit()

// --- parse parameters ---
// URL mode params
urlStr = cli.String("url", cli.setHelp("target URL for URL mode"), cli.setRequired(false))
method = cli.String("method", cli.setHelp("HTTP method"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{"type":"string","pattern":"^[!#$%&'*+.^_~\u00600-9A-Za-z|-]+$"}`), cli.setDefault("GET"))
headers = cli.String("headers", cli.setHelp("custom headers; accept 'Key: Value' per line OR a JSON object {key:value} (AI may pass either); omit when empty"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{
    "oneOf": [
        {"type":"string"},
        {"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"oneOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]}},
        {"type":"array","maxItems":0}
    ]
}`), cli.setRequired(false))
body = cli.String("body", cli.setHelp("request body content"), cli.setRequired(false))
contentType = cli.String("content-type", cli.setHelp("Content-Type header"), cli.setRequired(false))
queryValues = cli.Json("query", cli.setHelp("structured URL query values; pass original unescaped values and the tool URL-encodes them once; omit when empty (an empty [] is accepted for UI compatibility)"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{
    "description": "Query key/value pairs. Values must be original and unescaped. Empty arrays are accepted only as an empty-value compatibility form.",
    "oneOf": [
        {"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"oneOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]}},
        {"type":"array","maxItems":0}
    ]
}`), cli.setDefault("{}"), cli.setRequired(false))
formValues = cli.Json("form", cli.setHelp("structured form values; pass original unescaped values and the tool emits application/x-www-form-urlencoded; omit when empty (an empty [] is accepted for UI compatibility)"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{
    "description": "Form key/value pairs. Values must be original and unescaped. Empty arrays are accepted only as an empty-value compatibility form.",
    "oneOf": [
        {"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"oneOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]}},
        {"type":"array","maxItems":0}
    ]
}`), cli.setDefault("{}"), cli.setRequired(false))
queryParams = cli.String("query-params", cli.setHelp("legacy k=v&k2=v2 query string or compatibility object; ambiguous for literal '&', prefer query object"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{
    "oneOf": [
        {"type":"string"},
        {"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"oneOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]}},
        {"type":"array","maxItems":0}
    ]
}`), cli.setRequired(false))
postParams = cli.String("post-params", cli.setHelp("legacy k=v&k2=v2 form string or compatibility object; ambiguous for literal '&', prefer form object"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{
    "oneOf": [
        {"type":"string"},
        {"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"oneOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]}},
        {"type":"array","maxItems":0}
    ]
}`), cli.setRequired(false))

// Packet mode params
packet = cli.String("packet", cli.setHelp("raw HTTP request packet for Packet mode; request target/query must already be encoded"), cli.setRequired(false))

// Template rendering is opt-in for existing raw request callers.
fuzztag = cli.Bool("fuzztag", cli.setDefault(false), cli.setHelp("render FuzzTag in packet or URL-mode fields before encoding; single or multiple variants are sent automatically"))
variables = cli.Json("variables", cli.setDefault("{}"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"oneOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"array","items":{"oneOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]}}]}}`), cli.setHelp("named scalar/array values used by {{params(name)}}; inserted values remain literal"))

maxRequests = cli.Int("max-requests", cli.setDefault(100), cli.setHelp("maximum rendered requests; exceeding this limit sends nothing"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":500}`))
concurrent = cli.Int("concurrent", cli.setDefault(5), cli.setHelp("concurrent requests for multi-packet tests; 1 sends sequentially"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50}`))

// Batch presentation controls; single requests retain their detailed output.
delaySeconds = cli.Float("delay-seconds", cli.setDefault(0.0), cli.setHelp("delay between batch requests; forces sequential sending"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{"type":"number","minimum":0}`))
includeCode = cli.String("include-code", cli.setHelp("show only these response status codes, comma-separated"))
excludeCode = cli.String("exclude-code", cli.setHelp("hide these response status codes, comma-separated"))
excludeSize = cli.String("exclude-size", cli.setHelp("hide response body sizes or ranges, e.g. 0,400-600"))
maxBodySize = cli.Int("max-body-size", cli.setDefault(4096), cli.setHelp("batch response preview byte limit; 0 hides preview; complete responses are saved"), cli.setJsonSchema(`{"type":"integer","minimum":0}`))

// Common params
httpsMode = cli.String("https", cli.setHelp("force HTTPS: yes/no/auto"), cli.setDefault("auto"))
timeout = cli.Int("timeout", cli.setHelp("request timeout in seconds"), cli.setDefault(10))
redirectTimes = cli.Int("redirect-times", cli.setHelp("max redirect follows, 0 to disable"), cli.setDefault(3))
keyword = cli.String("keyword", cli.setHelp("keyword to highlight in response"), cli.setRequired(false))
regexpMatch = cli.String("regexp-match", cli.setHelp("regex to search in response"), cli.setRequired(false))
// save-packet: dump the full request AND response packets to temp files. OFF by default
// to keep output small; the packets are still printed inline (truncated for large bodies).
// 用 cli.Bool: AI 传 JSON true 时, 执行器注入裸 --save-packet 标志, cli.Bool 读到 true.
savePacket = cli.Bool("save-packet", cli.setHelp("dump full request+response packets to temp files (default off; packets are still printed inline)"))
// 最终请求报文始终输出，确保 AI 能核对参数实际生成的 packet；verbose 只控制模式行和连接 trace。
verbose = cli.Bool("verbose", cli.setHelp("verbose output: print connection trace + mode line; the generated request packet is always printed"))
proxy = cli.String("proxy", cli.setHelp("proxy URL, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:8080"), cli.setRequired(false))
cli.check()

// RESULT is the objective HTTP execution channel. A received 404/500 is still
// a received response; it must not be collapsed into a protocol failure.
newResult = func() {
    return {
        "request_built": false,
        "request_sent": false,
        "request_completed": false,
        "response_received": false,
        "status_code": nil,
        "body_size": 0,
        "keyword": keyword,
        "keyword_match_count": 0,
        "regexp": regexpMatch,
        "regexp_match_count": 0,
        "regexp_valid": true,
        "redirect_count": 0,
        "duration_ms": 0,
        "transport_error": nil,
        "filtered": false,
        "filter_reason": "",
        "artifact_error": nil,
    }
}
RESULT = newResult()

// Safe scalar recovery. Keep the correction visible so the AI knows which
// effective values were used instead of silently changing request behavior.
if str.TrimSpace(method) == "" {
    yakit.Warn("empty method normalized to GET; pass method=GET explicitly next time")
    method = "GET"
}
method = str.ToUpper(str.TrimSpace(method))
if timeout <= 0 {
    yakit.Warn("timeout=%v is not a safe bounded timeout; normalized to 10 seconds", timeout)
    timeout = 10
}
if redirectTimes < 0 {
    yakit.Warn("redirect-times=%v is invalid; normalized to 0 (redirects disabled)", redirectTimes)
    redirectTimes = 0
}

// --- normalize legacy params ---
// Object arguments now cross the AI-tool -> CLI boundary as JSON. Keep support for
// old direct callers that put an object into the legacy string fields, but retain the
// object until request construction so special characters never pass through k=v&...
// splitting. The map[...] branch only preserves compatibility with older executors.
normalizeMapLike = func(raw, pairSep, kvSep) {
    if raw == "" || raw == nil {
        return ""
    }
    s = sprint(raw)
    trimmed = str.TrimSpace(s)
    // 形如 map[k1:v1 k2:v2] (Go fmt.Sprint of a map) -> 拆成 pair 列表
    if str.HasPrefix(trimmed, "map[") && str.HasSuffix(trimmed, "]") {
        inner = str.TrimSpace(str.TrimSuffix(str.TrimPrefix(trimmed, "map["), "]"))
        out = []
        for _, kv := range str.Split(inner, " ") {
            kv = str.TrimSpace(kv)
            if kv == "" {
                continue
            }
            // map 字面量里 key/value 用第一个冒号 ":" 分隔
            colonIdx = str.Index(kv, ":")
            if colonIdx > 0 {
                out.Push(sprintf("%v%v%v", str.TrimSpace(str.SplitN(kv, ":", 2)[0]), kvSep, str.TrimSpace(str.SplitN(kv, ":", 2)[1])))
            } else {
                out.Push(sprintf("%v%v", kv, kvSep))
            }
        }
        return str.Join(out, pairSep)
    }
    return s
}

// headers 归一化: 接受 "Key: Value\n..." 或对象; 输出 "Key: Value\n..."
normalizeHeaders = func(raw) {
    if raw == "" || raw == nil {
        return ""
    }
    s = sprint(raw)
    trimmed = str.TrimSpace(s)
    if str.HasPrefix(trimmed, "{") && str.HasSuffix(trimmed, "}") {
        try {
            values = json.loads(trimmed)
            out = []
            for key, value := range values {
                out.Push(sprintf("%v: %v", key, value))
            }
            return str.Join(out, "\n")
        } catch e {}
    }
    if str.HasPrefix(trimmed, "map[") && str.HasSuffix(trimmed, "]") {
        inner = str.TrimSpace(str.TrimSuffix(str.TrimPrefix(trimmed, "map["), "]"))
        out = []
        for _, kv := range str.Split(inner, " ") {
            kv = str.TrimSpace(kv)
            if kv == "" {
                continue
            }
            colonIdx = str.Index(kv, ":")
            if colonIdx > 0 {
                out.Push(sprintf("%v: %v", str.TrimSpace(str.SplitN(kv, ":", 2)[0]), str.TrimSpace(str.SplitN(kv, ":", 2)[1])))
            }
        }
        return str.Join(out, "\n")
    }
    return s
}

normalizeLegacyParams = func(raw) {
    if raw == "" || raw == nil {
        return {"raw": "", "values": {}}
    }
    s = sprint(raw)
    trimmed = str.TrimSpace(s)
    if str.HasPrefix(trimmed, "{") && str.HasSuffix(trimmed, "}") {
        try {
            return {"raw": "", "values": json.loads(trimmed)}
        } catch e {}
    }
    return {"raw": normalizeMapLike(s, "&", "="), "values": {}}
}

headers = normalizeHeaders(headers)
normalizedQueryParams = normalizeLegacyParams(queryParams)
queryParams = normalizedQueryParams["raw"]
legacyQueryValues = normalizedQueryParams["values"]
normalizedPostParams = normalizeLegacyParams(postParams)
postParams = normalizedPostParams["raw"]
legacyFormValues = normalizedPostParams["values"]

// --- validation ---
if packet == "" && urlStr == "" {
    die("either 'url' (URL mode) or 'packet' (Packet mode) must be provided")
}

// Render before URL/form encoding. Related fields share one expansion so
// synchronization labels work across the URL, query/form values and headers.
requestCtx = context.Background()
injectedCtx = getParam("CTX")
if injectedCtx != nil && injectedCtx != "" { requestCtx = injectedCtx }
if maxRequests < 1 || maxRequests > 500 { die("max-requests must be between 1 and 500") }
if concurrent < 1 || concurrent > 50 { die("concurrent must be between 1 and 50") }

if maxBodySize < 0 || delaySeconds < 0 { die("max-body-size and delay-seconds must be nonnegative") }
parseCodes = func(raw) {
    codes = make(map[int]bool)
    for _, text := range str.SplitAndTrim(raw, ",") {
        code, err := atoi(text)
        if err != nil || code < 100 || code > 999 { die(sprintf("invalid status code: %v", text)) }
        codes[code] = true
    }
    return codes
}
includeCodeSet, excludeCodeSet = parseCodes(includeCode), parseCodes(excludeCode)
excludeSizeRanges = []
for _, text := range str.SplitAndTrim(excludeSize, ",") {
    parts = str.SplitN(text, "-", 2)
    start, err := atoi(parts[0])
    if err != nil || start < 0 { die(sprintf("invalid exclude-size: %v", text)) }
    end = start
    if len(parts) == 2 {
        end, err = atoi(parts[1])
        if err != nil || end < start { die(sprintf("invalid exclude-size: %v", text)) }
    }
    excludeSizeRanges.Push({"start":start, "end":end})
}
filterReason = func(status, size) {
    if excludeCodeSet[status] { return "excluded-code" }
    if len(includeCodeSet) > 0 && !includeCodeSet[status] { return "not-in-include-code" }
    for _, sizeRange := range excludeSizeRanges {
        if size >= sizeRange["start"] && size <= sizeRange["end"] { return "excluded-size" }
    }
    return ""
}

// Expand all variants before sending; per-row maps prevent concurrent workers
// from overwriting values belonging to another request.
requestItems = []
if packet != "" {
    packets = [packet]
    if fuzztag {
        packets, renderErr = fuzz.RenderHTTPTemplate(packet, variables, maxRequests, requestCtx)
        if renderErr != nil { die(sprintf("FuzzTag render failed before sending: %v", renderErr)) }
    }
    for _, renderedPacket := range packets {
        requestItems.Push({"packet":renderedPacket, "method":method, "body":body, "content_type":contentType})
    }
} else {
    fields = [urlStr, method, headers, body, contentType, queryParams, postParams]
    valueMaps = [legacyQueryValues, queryValues, legacyFormValues, formValues]
    keys = []
    for _, values := range valueMaps {
        mapKeys = []
        for key, value := range values {
            mapKeys.Push(key)
            fields.Push(sprint(value))
        }
        keys.Push(mapKeys)
    }
    rows = [fields]
    if fuzztag {
        rows, renderErr = fuzz.RenderHTTPFields(fields, variables, maxRequests, requestCtx)
        if renderErr != nil { die(sprintf("FuzzTag render failed before sending: %v", renderErr)) }
    }
    for _, row := range rows {
        maps = []
        offset = 7
        for _, mapKeys := range keys {
            values = {}
            for _, key := range mapKeys {
                values[key] = row[offset]
                offset++
            }
            maps.Push(values)
        }
        requestItems.Push({"packet":"", "url":row[0], "method":row[1], "headers":row[2],
            "body":row[3], "content_type":row[4], "query_params":row[5], "post_params":row[6],
            "legacy_query":maps[0], "query":maps[1], "legacy_form":maps[2], "form":maps[3]})
    }
}
batchMode = len(requestItems) > 1

executeRequest = func(item, RESULT) {
    defer func() { RESULT["request_completed"] = true }()
    // Local parameters and execution state are isolated for every worker.
    packet, urlStr, method, headers, body, contentType, queryParams, postParams := item["packet"], item["url"], item["method"], item["headers"], item["body"], item["content_type"], item["query_params"], item["post_params"]
    legacyQueryValues, queryValues, legacyFormValues, formValues := item["legacy_query"], item["query"], item["legacy_form"], item["form"]
    // --- build poc options ---
    opts = [poc.context(requestCtx)]
    redirectLogs = []

    // timeout
    if timeout > 0 {
        opts.Push(poc.timeout(float64(timeout)))
    }

    // redirect handling
    redirectCount = 0
    if redirectTimes <= 0 {
        opts.Push(poc.noRedirect(true))
    } else {
        opts.Push(poc.noRedirect(false), poc.redirectTimes(int(redirectTimes)))
        opts.Push(poc.redirectHandler((redirectIsHttps, redirectReq, redirectRsp) => {
            redirectCount++
            redirectUrl = poc.GetHTTPPacketHeader(redirectRsp, "Location")
            statusCode = poc.GetStatusCodeFromResponse(redirectRsp)
            if !batchMode || verbose { yakit.Info("redirect #%d [%v] -> %v", redirectCount, statusCode, redirectUrl) }
            logEntry = sprintf("========== Redirect #%d [Status: %v] ==========\nTarget: %v\n\n--- Request ---\n%v\n\n--- Response ---\n%v\n\n",
                redirectCount, statusCode, redirectUrl, string(redirectReq), string(redirectRsp))
            redirectLogs.Push(logEntry)
            return true
        }))
    }

    // proxy
    if proxy != "" {
        opts.Push(poc.proxy(proxy))
        if !batchMode || verbose { yakit.Info("using proxy: %v", proxy) }
    }

    // --- determine HTTPS ---
    resolveHttps = func(isAutoDetected) {
        httpsLower = str.ToLower(httpsMode)
        if httpsLower == "yes" || httpsLower == "y" || httpsLower == "true" {
            return true
        }
        if httpsLower == "no" || httpsLower == "n" || httpsLower == "false" {
            return false
        }
        // auto mode: use detected value
        return isAutoDetected
    }

    // --- build and send request ---
    rawPacket = undefined
    isHttps = false

    if packet != "" {
        // === Packet Mode ===
        if verbose { yakit.Info("mode: Packet (raw HTTP request)") }
        rawPacket = []byte(packet)

        // detect HTTPS from packet Host header
        host = poc.GetHTTPPacketHeader(rawPacket, "Host")
        autoHttps = str.HasPrefix(str.ToLower(host), "443") || str.Contains(host, ":443")
        isHttps = resolveHttps(autoHttps)

        url = poc.GetUrlFromHTTPRequest(isHttps ? "https" : "http", rawPacket)
        methodStr = poc.GetHTTPRequestMethod(rawPacket)
        // 单行请求摘要: 默认就打 (一行, 高价值); 完整 target 行只在 verbose 下打.
        if url != "" && (!batchMode || verbose) {
            yakit.Info("request: %v %v", methodStr, url)
            if verbose { yakit.Info("packet target: [%v] %v (https=%v)", methodStr, url, isHttps) }
        }
    } else {
        // === URL Mode ===
        if verbose { yakit.Info("mode: URL (%v %v)", method, urlStr) }
        // 单行请求摘要: 默认就打, 让 AI 知道这次打的是哪个 URL.
        if !batchMode || verbose { yakit.Info("request: %v %v", method, urlStr) }

        // parse URL to raw packet
        if batchMode { RESULT["url"] = urlStr }
        autoHttps, parsedPacket, err := poc.ParseUrlToHTTPRequestRaw(method, urlStr)
        if err != nil {
            yakit.Error("failed to parse URL to HTTP request: %v. Recovery: provide an absolute URL such as https://host/path, or use packet mode when exact request bytes are required. Request was not sent.", err)
            RESULT["transport_error"] = "request_build_error: " + sprint(err)
            return RESULT
        }
        rawPacket = parsedPacket
        isHttps = resolveHttps(autoHttps)

        // apply custom Content-Type
        if contentType != "" {
            rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketHeader(rawPacket, "Content-Type", contentType)
        }

        // apply custom headers
        if headers != "" {
            headerLineIndex = 0
            for _, line := range str.SplitAndTrim(headers, "\n") {
                headerLineIndex++
                line = str.TrimSpace(line)
                if line == "" {
                    continue
                }
                idx = str.Index(line, ":")
                if idx <= 0 {
                    yakit.Warn("ignored malformed header line #%v: expected 'Name: value'. Fix the headers parameter and retry if this header is required.", headerLineIndex)
                    continue
                }
                hKey = str.TrimSpace(str.SplitN(line, ":", 2)[0])
                hVal = str.TrimSpace(str.SplitN(line, ":", 2)[1])
                if hKey != "" {
                    rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketHeader(rawPacket, hKey, hVal)
                }
            }
        }

        // apply query params
        if queryParams != "" {
            for _, pair := range str.SplitAndTrim(queryParams, "&") {
                parts = str.SplitN(pair, "=", 2)
                if len(parts) == 2 {
                    rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketQueryParam(rawPacket, parts[0], parts[1])
                } elif len(parts) == 1 && parts[0] != "" {
                    rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketQueryParam(rawPacket, parts[0], "")
                }
            }
        }

        // Object values stay structurally separate until this point. The lowhttp patcher
        // performs the one and only URL-encoding pass.
        for key, value := range legacyQueryValues {
            rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketQueryParam(rawPacket, sprint(key), sprint(value))
        }
        for key, value := range queryValues {
            rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketQueryParam(rawPacket, sprint(key), sprint(value))
        }

        // Apply form params only when there is no raw body. `body` is the explicit raw
        // representation and therefore wins without inheriting a form Content-Type.
        if body == "" {
            hasFormValues = postParams != "" || len(legacyFormValues) > 0 || len(formValues) > 0
            if hasFormValues {
                rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketHeader(rawPacket, "Content-Type", "application/x-www-form-urlencoded")
            }
            if postParams != "" {
                for _, pair := range str.SplitAndTrim(postParams, "&") {
                    parts = str.SplitN(pair, "=", 2)
                    if len(parts) == 2 {
                        rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketPostParam(rawPacket, parts[0], parts[1])
                    } elif len(parts) == 1 && parts[0] != "" {
                        rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketPostParam(rawPacket, parts[0], "")
                    }
                }
            }
            for key, value := range legacyFormValues {
                rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketPostParam(rawPacket, sprint(key), sprint(value))
            }
            for key, value := range formValues {
                rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketPostParam(rawPacket, sprint(key), sprint(value))
            }
        }

        // Apply the raw body last.
        if body != "" {
            rawPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketBody(rawPacket, []byte(body))
        }
    }

    opts.Push(poc.https(isHttps))
    RESULT["request_built"] = rawPacket != nil && len(rawPacket) > 0

    // AI 必须在请求成功或失败前都能看到参数实际生成的 packet，才能快速修订编码、
    // header 和 body。大报文仅截断展示；save-packet 仍负责把完整报文落盘。
    printRequestPacket = func(label, requestPacket) {
        packetSize = len(requestPacket)
        if packetSize <= 0 {
            yakit.Info("%v: (empty)", label)
            return
        }
        if packetSize <= 5120 {
            yakit.Info("%v (%v bytes):\n%v", label, packetSize, string(requestPacket))
            return
        }
        if savePacket {
            yakit.Info("%v (%v bytes, truncated to 5KB):\n%v\n... (truncated, full request will be saved to file)", label, packetSize, string(requestPacket[:5120]))
        } else {
            yakit.Info("%v (%v bytes, truncated to 5KB):\n%v\n... (truncated; set save-packet=true to dump the full packet to a file)", label, packetSize, string(requestPacket[:5120]))
        }
    }

    // --- execute request ---
    if !batchMode || verbose { printRequestPacket("request packet", rawPacket) }
    if batchMode {
        RESULT["url"] = poc.GetUrlFromHTTPRequest(isHttps ? "https" : "http", rawPacket)
        RESULT["request_size"] = len(rawPacket)
        RESULT["request"] = string(rawPacket[:min(len(rawPacket), 5120)])
        RESULT["request_truncated"] = len(rawPacket) > 5120
        RESULT["path"] = poc.GetHTTPRequestPath(rawPacket)
        RESULT["https"] = isHttps
        if savePacket {
            reqFile, saveErr := file.TempFileName("http-request-*.txt")
            if saveErr == nil {
                saveErr = file.Save(reqFile, string(rawPacket))
                if saveErr == nil { RESULT["request_file"] = reqFile }
            }
            if saveErr != nil { RESULT["artifact_error"] = sprint(saveErr) }
        }
    }
    RESULT["request_sent"] = true
    requestStartedAt = time.Now()
    rspIns, _, err := poc.HTTPEx(rawPacket, opts...)
    RESULT["duration_ms"] = time.Since(requestStartedAt).Milliseconds()
    if err != nil {
        if !batchMode || verbose { yakit.Error("HTTP request failed: %v. Recovery: inspect the generated request packet above, verify URL/DNS/TLS/proxy and authentication headers, then retry; increase timeout only for a known-slow endpoint, or use packet mode for exact bytes. No response packet was received.", err) }
        RESULT["transport_error"] = sprint(err)
        return RESULT
    }

    rsp = rspIns.RawPacket
    req = rspIns.RawRequest
    RESULT["response_received"] = true
    RESULT["status_code"] = poc.GetStatusCodeFromResponse(rsp)
    RESULT["body_size"] = rspIns.ResponseBodySize

    // --- form-encoded 兜底重试 ---
    // 现场问题: AI 对登录/表单类接口习惯发 application/json, 但很多服务端只收
    // application/x-www-form-urlencoded (见 redhaze login.js: URLSearchParams + form),
    // 导致明明带了字段却收到 400 "xxx and password are required" / "invalid request body",
    // AI 误以为是字段名错了而死磕 (run-2/run-3 各 9 次, 漏掉 SQLi 认证绕过).
    // 这里兜底: 当 POST + JSON body + 400 + 响应像"字段必填/invalid body" 时, 自动把 JSON
    // body 转成 form-encoded 重发一次, 并明确提示 AI "JSON 被拒, 已用 form 重试".
    // 关键词: do_http_request form 重试, content-type 不匹配, application/x-www-form-urlencoded
    tryFormRetryOnJsonRejected = func() {
        // 只对 POST + URL 模式 + 用了 body 的情况生效.
        if packet != "" {
            return false
        }
        if str.ToUpper(method) != "POST" {
            return false
        }
        if body == "" {
            return false
        }
        // 原始请求必须是 JSON (AI 主动带了 application/json).
        ct = str.ToLower(str.TrimSpace(contentType))
        if !str.Contains(ct, "json") {
            return false
        }
        // 响应必须是 400.
        statusCode = poc.GetStatusCodeFromResponse(rsp)
        if statusCode != 400 {
            return false
        }
        // 响应体像"字段必填 / invalid body"这类典型的 content-type/编码不匹配信号.
        bodyLower = str.ToLower(poc.GetHTTPPacketBody(rsp))
        isRejectedSignal = str.Contains(bodyLower, "required") || str.Contains(bodyLower, "invalid") || str.Contains(bodyLower, "missing")
        if !isRejectedSignal {
            return false
        }
        // 把 JSON body 转成 form-encoded: {"a":"b","c":"d"} -> a=b&c=d
        // 不依赖 JSON 库: AI 发的登录 body 通常是扁平对象, 用字符串切分即可.
        // 去掉外层大括号后按逗号切分, 每段按第一个冒号切 k/v, 去掉首尾引号.
        inner = str.Trim(str.TrimSpace(body), "{}")
        if inner == "" {
            return false
        }
        pairs = []
        for _, seg := range str.Split(inner, ",") {
            kv = str.SplitN(seg, ":", 2)
            if len(kv) == 2 {
                fk = str.Trim(str.TrimSpace(kv[0]), "\"")
                fv = str.Trim(str.TrimSpace(kv[1]), "\"")
                if fk != "" {
                    pairs.Push(sprintf("%v=%v", codec.EscapeQueryUrl(fk), codec.EscapeQueryUrl(fv)))
                }
            }
        }
        if len(pairs) == 0 {
            return false
        }
        formBody = str.Join(pairs, "&")

        // 用同一份 rawPacket, 换 Content-Type 为 form, 换 body 为 formBody, 重新发送.
        retryPacket = rawPacket
        retryPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketHeader(retryPacket, "Content-Type", "application/x-www-form-urlencoded")
        retryPacket = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketBody(retryPacket, []byte(formBody))
        printRequestPacket("retry request packet", retryPacket)
        retryRspIns, _, retryErr := poc.HTTPEx(retryPacket, opts...)
        if retryErr != nil {
            return false
        }
        // 只有当 form 重试后状态码不再是 400 时, 才认为重试"奏效" (服务端接受了 form),
        // 此时把 req/rsp 替换成重试的版本, 并提示 AI.
        retryStatusCode = poc.GetStatusCodeFromResponse(retryRspIns.RawPacket)
        if retryStatusCode == 400 {
            return false
        }
        yakit.Info("[content-type hint] JSON body was rejected with HTTP 400 (likely '%v'). Retried the SAME request as application/x-www-form-urlencoded and the server accepted it (now HTTP %v). => This endpoint expects FORM-ENCODED bodies, NOT JSON. For login/form endpoints like this, use post-params (or content-type=application/x-www-form-urlencoded) instead of a JSON body. The response being JSON does NOT mean the request should be JSON.", str.TrimSpace(poc.GetHTTPPacketBody(rsp)), retryStatusCode)
        rspIns = retryRspIns
        rsp = retryRspIns.RawPacket
        req = retryRspIns.RawRequest
        return true
    }

    if !batchMode { tryFormRetryOnJsonRejected() }
    RESULT["status_code"] = poc.GetStatusCodeFromResponse(rsp)
    RESULT["body_size"] = rspIns.ResponseBodySize
    RESULT["redirect_count"] = redirectCount

    if batchMode {
        // HTTPEx may fix request framing or follow redirects; retain actual bytes.
        RESULT["request_size"] = len(req)
        RESULT["request"] = string(req[:min(len(req), 5120)])
        RESULT["request_truncated"] = len(req) > 5120
        if RESULT["request_file"] != nil {
            saveErr := file.Save(RESULT["request_file"], string(req))
            if saveErr != nil { RESULT["artifact_error"] = sprint(saveErr) }
        }
        RESULT["response_size"] = len(rsp)
        RESULT["response"] = string(rsp[:min(len(rsp), 5120)])
        RESULT["response_truncated"] = len(rsp) > 5120
        RESULT["response_preview"] = codec.FixUTF8(rsp[:min(len(rsp), maxBodySize)])
        RESULT["preview_truncated"] = len(rsp) > maxBodySize
        RESULT["filter_reason"] = filterReason(RESULT["status_code"], RESULT["body_size"])
        RESULT["filtered"] = RESULT["filter_reason"] != ""
        keywordMatches, regexpMatches = [], []
        matchBudget = 5000
        collectMatch = func(rg) {
            text := []byte(rg.GetTextContextWithPrompt(3))
            if len(text) > matchBudget { RESULT["match_preview_truncated"] = true }
            if matchBudget > 0 {
                preview := text[:min(len(text), matchBudget)]
                matchBudget -= len(preview)
                return codec.FixUTF8(preview)
            }
            return ""
        }
        if keyword != "" || regexpMatch != "" {
            edt = memeditor.New(string(rsp))
            if keyword != "" {
                edt.FindStringRange(keyword, rg => {
                    RESULT["keyword_match_count"]++
                    text := collectMatch(rg)
                    if text != "" { keywordMatches.Push(text) }
                    return nil
                })
            }
            if regexpMatch != "" {
                matchErr := edt.FindRegexpRange(regexpMatch, rg => {
                    RESULT["regexp_match_count"]++
                    text := collectMatch(rg)
                    if text != "" { regexpMatches.Push(text) }
                    return nil
                })
                if matchErr != nil {
                    RESULT["regexp_valid"] = false
                    RESULT["regexp_error"] = sprint(matchErr)
                }
            }
        }
        RESULT["keyword_matches"], RESULT["regexp_matches"] = keywordMatches, regexpMatches
        if verbose { yakit.Info("response #%v packet (%v bytes):\n%v", RESULT["idx"], len(rsp), RESULT["response"]) }
        // Save every complete batch response, including filtered responses.
        rspFile, saveErr := file.TempFileName("http-response-*.txt")
        if saveErr == nil {
            saveErr = file.Save(rspFile, string(rsp))
            if saveErr == nil { RESULT["response_file"] = rspFile }
        }
        if saveErr != nil { RESULT["artifact_error"] = sprint(saveErr) }
        return RESULT
    }

    // --- report results ---
    // connection info (verbose only; trace is noise for batch IDOR/enum flows)
    if verbose {
        if rspIns.PortIsOpen {
            yakit.Info("remote %v is open", rspIns.RemoteAddr)
        }
        try {
            yakit.Info("dns: %v, connect: %v, server: %v, total: %v",
                rspIns.TraceInfo.DNSTime.String(),
                rspIns.TraceInfo.ConnTime.String(),
                rspIns.TraceInfo.ServerTime.String(),
                rspIns.TraceInfo.TotalTime.String())
        } catch e {}
    }

    // status line
    try {
        rspStr = string(rsp)
        crlfIdx = str.Index(rspStr, "\r\n")
        if crlfIdx > 0 {
            statusLine = rspStr[:crlfIdx]
            yakit.Info("response: %v (body size: %v)", statusLine, rspIns.ResponseBodySize)
        } else {
            yakit.Info("response body size: %v", rspIns.ResponseBodySize)
        }
    } catch e {
        yakit.Info("response body size: %v", rspIns.ResponseBodySize)
    }

    // save request/response/redirect to files only when save-packet is enabled.
    // 默认不落盘, 保持输出精简; 完整报文已在内联打印中给出 (大报文会截断).
    if savePacket {
        reqFile, err := file.TempFileName("http-request-*.txt")
        if err == nil {
            file.Save(reqFile, string(req))
            yakit.Info("request packet [size:%v], full request saved to file: %v", len(req), reqFile)
        }

        rspFile, err := file.TempFileName("http-response-*.txt")
        if err != nil {
            yakit.Error("failed to create temp file for response: %v", err)
        } else {
            file.Save(rspFile, string(rsp))
            yakit.Info("response packet [size:%v] saved to %v", len(rsp), rspFile)
        }

        if len(redirectLogs) > 0 {
            redirectFile, err := file.TempFileName("http-redirect-logs-*.txt")
            if err == nil {
                file.Save(redirectFile, str.Join(redirectLogs, "\n"))
                yakit.Info("%d redirects recorded, saved to %v", len(redirectLogs), redirectFile)
            }
        }
    }

    // print response packet inline with size/pattern-aware logic
    hasPattern = (keyword != "" || regexpMatch != "")
    if len(rsp) > 0 {
        if hasPattern {
            if len(rsp) <= 5120 {
                yakit.Info("response packet (%v bytes):\n%v", len(rsp), string(rsp))
            } else {
                if savePacket {
                    yakit.Info("response packet too large (%v bytes), skip inline printing, see pattern match results below and saved file", len(rsp))
                } else {
                    yakit.Info("response packet too large (%v bytes), skip inline printing, see pattern match results below (set save-packet=true to dump the full packet to a file)", len(rsp))
                }
            }
        } else {
            if len(rsp) <= 10240 {
                yakit.Info("response packet (%v bytes):\n%v", len(rsp), string(rsp))
            } else {
                if savePacket {
                    yakit.Info("response packet (%v bytes, truncated to 10KB):\n%v\n... (truncated, full response saved to file)", len(rsp), string(rsp[:10240]))
                } else {
                    yakit.Info("response packet (%v bytes, truncated to 10KB):\n%v\n... (truncated; set save-packet=true to dump the full packet to a file)", len(rsp), string(rsp[:10240]))
                }
            }
        }
    } else {
        yakit.Error("response packet is empty after HTTP execution. Recovery: inspect the request packet and connection trace (verbose=true), verify the server did not close the connection, and retry with save-packet=true if the problem persists.")
    }

    // --- 表单接口探测提示 (治本) ---
    // 现场问题: AI 看到 JSON 响应就以为请求也该是 JSON, 但很多登录/表单接口其实是
    // form-encoded (见 redhaze login.js: URLSearchParams + application/x-www-form-urlencoded).
    // 当响应是 HTML 含 <form>/<input name=> 或 JS 用 URLSearchParams 提交时, 主动提示 AI
    // "这是表单接口, 字段是 X/Y, 用 form-encoded 而非 JSON", 从源头避免 AI 死磕 JSON.
    // 关键词: do_http_request 表单探测, form hint, URLSearchParams, 别用 JSON
    if method == "GET" || (method == "POST" && body == "") {
        rspText = string(rsp)
        rspLower = str.ToLower(rspText)
        hasFormHtml = str.Contains(rspLower, "<form") && str.Contains(rspLower, " name=")
        hasFormJs = str.Contains(rspText, "URLSearchParams") || str.Contains(rspText, "x-www-form-urlencoded")
        if hasFormHtml || hasFormJs {
            // 从响应里尽量提取 input 字段名, 帮 AI 直接拼请求.
            fieldNames = []
            for _, line := range str.Split(rspText, "\n") {
                lineLower = str.ToLower(line)
                if str.Contains(lineLower, "<input") {
                    // 提取 name="xxx" 或 name='xxx'
                    idx = str.Index(str.ToLower(line), "name=")
                    if idx > 0 {
                        rest = str.TrimSpace(line[idx+5:])
                        // 去掉引号
                        rest = str.Trim(rest, "\"'")
                        // 取到下一个空白/引号前
                        for _, ch := range [" ", "\t", ">", "/", "\"", "'"] {
                            ci = str.Index(rest, ch)
                            if ci > 0 {
                                rest = rest[:ci]
                            }
                        }
                        if rest != "" && rest != "submit" && rest != "button" {
                            fieldNames.Push(rest)
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            // 去重
            seen = {}
            uniqueFields = []
            for _, f := range fieldNames {
                if !seen[f] {
                    seen[f] = true
                    uniqueFields.Push(f)
                }
            }
            if len(uniqueFields) > 0 {
                yakit.Info("[form-endpoint hint] This response contains an HTML <form> / form-submit JS. The likely login/form fields are: [%v]. Such form endpoints usually expect application/x-www-form-urlencoded (use post-params), NOT a JSON body — even when the API response is JSON. Verify the real encoding (e.g. via the page's JS) before sending.", str.Join(uniqueFields, ", "))
            } else {
                yakit.Info("[form-endpoint hint] This response contains form-submit JS (URLSearchParams / x-www-form-urlencoded). The endpoint likely expects FORM-ENCODED bodies, NOT JSON. Use post-params instead of a JSON body.")
            }
        }
    }

    // keyword and regex matching
    keywordMatchCount = 0
    regexpMatchCount = 0
    if hasPattern {
        edt := memeditor.New(string(rsp))
        if keyword != "" {
            yakit.Info("searching keyword pattern: %v", keyword)
            edt.FindStringRange(keyword, rg => {
                keywordMatchCount++
                matchContent := rg.GetTextContextWithPrompt(3)
                if len(matchContent) > 30000 {
                    yakit.Info("keyword match [size:%v]:\n%v\n... (truncated)", len(matchContent), codec.FixUTF8([]byte(matchContent)[:30000]))
                } else {
                    yakit.Info("keyword match:\n%v", matchContent)
                }
            })
            if keywordMatchCount == 0 {
                yakit.Info("keyword match: not found in response (%v bytes). The HTTP response is still shown above; verify keyword spelling/case or retry without keyword to inspect the normal response preview.", len(rsp))
            }
        }
        if regexpMatch != "" {
            yakit.Info("searching regexp pattern: %v", regexpMatch)
            try {
                edt.FindRegexpRange(regexpMatch, rg => {
                    regexpMatchCount++
                    matchContent := rg.GetTextContextWithPrompt(3)
                    if len(matchContent) > 30000 {
                        yakit.Info("regexp match [size:%v]:\n%v\n... (truncated)", len(matchContent), codec.FixUTF8([]byte(matchContent)[:30000]))
                    } else {
                        yakit.Info("regexp match:\n%v", matchContent)
                    }
                })
                if regexpMatchCount == 0 {
                    yakit.Info("regexp match: not found in response (%v bytes). Verify the expression or retry without regexp-match to inspect the normal response preview.", len(rsp))
                }
            } catch e {
                RESULT["regexp_valid"] = false
                yakit.Error("invalid regexp-match %q: %v. Recovery: correct or remove regexp-match and retry; the HTTP request itself completed and its response summary is shown above.", regexpMatch, e)
            }
        }
    }

    if keyword != "" {
        RESULT["keyword_match_count"] = keywordMatchCount
    }
    if regexpMatch != "" {
        RESULT["regexp_match_count"] = regexpMatchCount
    }

    return RESULT
}

if !batchMode {
    RESULT = executeRequest(requestItems[0], newResult())
} else {
    if delaySeconds > 0 {
        concurrent = 1
        yakit.Info("Delay specified, forcing sequential execution (concurrent=1)")
    }
    yakit.Info("=== HTTP FuzzTag multi-packet test: %d requests, concurrent=%d ===", len(requestItems), concurrent)
    // Store by template index, so completion order cannot change comparisons.
    results = make([]map[string]any, len(requestItems))
    swg = sync.NewSizedWaitGroup(concurrent)
    for i, item := range requestItems {
        swg.Add()
        go func(idx, requestItem) {
            defer swg.Done()
            state = newResult()
            state["idx"] = idx + 1
            result = state
            try {
                result = executeRequest(requestItem, state)
            } catch e {
                result["request_completed"] = true
                if result["response_received"] {
                    result["artifact_error"] = "execution_error: " + sprint(e)
                } else {
                    result["transport_error"] = "execution_error: " + sprint(e)
                }
            }
            results[idx] = result
            yakit.Info("[%d/%d] %v -> status=%v, body=%v bytes, duration=%vms, keyword=%v, regexp=%v (valid=%v), filtered=%v, error=%v",
                idx+1, len(requestItems), result["url"], result["status_code"], result["body_size"],
                result["duration_ms"], result["keyword_match_count"], result["regexp_match_count"], result["regexp_valid"], result["filtered"], result["transport_error"])
            if delaySeconds > 0 && idx < len(requestItems)-1 {
                // Keep cancellation effective while pacing sequential requests.
                timer := time.NewTimer(delaySeconds)
                select {
                    case <-requestCtx.Done():
                    case <-timer.C:
                }
                timer.Stop()
            }
        }(i, item)
    }
    swg.Wait()
    sentCount, responseCount, errorCount, filteredCount = 0, 0, 0, 0
    statusDistribution = {}
    for _, result := range results {
        if result["request_sent"] { sentCount++ }
        if result["response_received"] {
            responseCount++
            status = sprint(result["status_code"])
            if statusDistribution[status] == nil { statusDistribution[status] = 0 }
            statusDistribution[status]++
        }
        if result["filtered"] { filteredCount++ }
        if result["transport_error"] != nil { errorCount++ }
    }
    RESULT = {"mode":"multi", "request_count":len(requestItems), "request_completed_count":len(results),
        "request_sent_count":sentCount, "response_received_count":responseCount, "filtered_count":filteredCount,
        "transport_error_count":errorCount, "status_code_distribution":statusDistribution, "items":results}
    outputContent = sprintf("=== Batch Request Summary ===\nTotal: %d, Sent: %d, Responses: %d, Filtered: %d, Transport errors: %d\nStatus distribution: %v\n\n",
        len(requestItems), sentCount, responseCount, filteredCount, errorCount, statusDistribution)
    for _, result := range results {
        if result["filtered"] { continue }
        outputContent += sprintf("--- Request #%d ---\nURL: %v\nPath: %v\nHTTPS: %v\nStatus: %v\nSize: %v bytes\nDuration: %vms\nrequest #%d packet (preview):\n%v\n",
            result["idx"], result["url"], result["path"], result["https"], result["status_code"], result["body_size"], result["duration_ms"], result["idx"], result["request"])
        if result["response_received"] {
            outputContent += sprintf("Full response: %v\n", result["response_file"])
            if maxBodySize > 0 {
                outputContent += sprintf("Response%s:\n%v\n", result["preview_truncated"] ? " (truncated)" : "", result["response_preview"])
            }
            for _, text := range result["keyword_matches"] { outputContent += sprintf("Keyword Match [%v]:\n%v\n", keyword, text) }
            for _, text := range result["regexp_matches"] { outputContent += sprintf("Regexp Match [%v]:\n%v\n", regexpMatch, text) }
            if keyword != "" && result["keyword_match_count"] == 0 { outputContent += "Keyword Match: not found\n" }
            if regexpMatch != "" && result["regexp_match_count"] == 0 { outputContent += "Regexp Match: not found\n" }
            if result["regexp_valid"] == false { outputContent += sprintf("Regexp error: %v\n", result["regexp_error"]) }
        } else {
            outputContent += sprintf("Transport error: %v\n", result["transport_error"])
        }
        if result["artifact_error"] != nil { outputContent += sprintf("Artifact error: %v\n", result["artifact_error"]) }
        outputContent += "\n"
    }
    outputContent += "=== Results Summary Table ===\nIndex | Path | Status | Size | Duration | Filter\n"
    for _, result := range results {
        outputContent += sprintf("%d | %v | %v | %v | %vms | %v\n", result["idx"], result["path"],
            result["response_received"] ? sprint(result["status_code"]) : "ERROR", result["body_size"], result["duration_ms"], result["filter_reason"])
    }
    outputFile, saveErr = file.TempFileName("http-results-*.txt")
    if saveErr == nil { saveErr = file.Save(outputFile, outputContent) }
    if saveErr != nil { RESULT["artifact_error"] = sprint(saveErr) } else {
        RESULT["output_file"] = outputFile
        yakit.Info("Results saved to: %v", outputFile)
    }
    outputBytes = []byte(outputContent)
    yakit.Info("%v", codec.FixUTF8(outputBytes[:min(len(outputBytes), 50000)]))
    if len(outputBytes) > 50000 { yakit.Info("... (output truncated at 50000 bytes, see full results in saved file)") }
    yakit.Info("multi-packet summary: requests=%d, sent=%d, responses=%d, filtered=%d, errors=%d, status=%v",
        len(requestItems), sentCount, responseCount, filteredCount, errorCount, statusDistribution)
}
